@trackerUrl = http://localhost:3030
# Tracker consumes Kafka and exposes bottle state. After POST to detector, wait ~1s then GET /bottles or /bottles/:id.

### List all bottles
GET {{trackerUrl}}/bottles

### Get one bottle by id
GET {{trackerUrl}}/bottles/bottle-0001

### List bottles by status: detected | valid | to_reject | rejected
GET {{trackerUrl}}/bottles/status/detected

### Counts by status
GET {{trackerUrl}}/stats

### Health
GET {{trackerUrl}}/health
